    cof:title "133A(7) Reviews of the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(7) The Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman must:  (a) give a copy of the report to the Minister; and  (b) publish the report on the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman’s website. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2014A00003  Amendments  Schedule 1 Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman scheme  Part 2  No. 3, 2014 Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Consumer Protection) Act 2014  Response to recommendations in report" ;
